<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#0A0A0A;">Quotazione pronta</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">Il backoffice Keus ha valutato le personalizzazioni richieste per {{companyName}} sull'ordine <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{orderCode}}</strong>.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border:1px solid #E7E1D8;border-radius:10px;border-collapse:separate;">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#FAF7F2" style="background-color:#FAF7F2;padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#817B78;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E1D8;border-top-left-radius:10px;">Personalizzazione</td>
<td bgcolor="#FAF7F2" style="background-color:#FAF7F2;padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#817B78;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E1D8;border-top-right-radius:10px;">Esito</td>
</tr>
{{#each customizations}}
<tr>
<td valign="top" style="padding:12px 16px;font-size:14px;color:#0A0A0A;">{{label}}</td>
<td valign="top" style="padding:12px 16px;font-size:14px;color:#0A0A0A;">{{#if refused}}Non accolta: {{reason}}{{else}}Quotata{{/if}}</td>
</tr>
{{/each}}
</table>
<p style="margin:24px 0 0 0;">Nell'ordine trovi gli importi; da lì si prosegue verso l'offerta.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:28px 0 0 0;">
<tr>
<td class="rk-btn" ${button_cell}>
<a href="{{orderUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Apri l'ordine</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
